{"overview":"«کلانک، کلانک، کلانک، کلانک...» امروز، میله عبور راه‌آهن دوباره پایین می‌آید و مسیری را که کسی در حال رفتن به جایی است، متوقف می‌کند. داستان‌های مختلف جوانی، عشق، هنر، اولین عشق و … که در زمان انتظار در عبور راه‌آهن رخ می‌دهند... تمام عبورهای راه‌آهن، تمام زمان‌ها. مجموعه‌ای از داستان‌های کوتاه درباره عبورهای راه‌آهن برای شما!","tagline":"","overview_en":"“Clank, clank, clank, clank...”\n\nToday, the railroad crossing bar goes down again, stopping someone on their way somewhere. The various stories of youth, eros, art, first love, etc that occur during the time spent waiting at a railroad crossing... All railroad crossings, all the time. Bringing you a variety of short stories about railroad crossings!","tagline_en":"","runtime":3,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2018,"poster":"/nZThYpa9pvXH96yMQ5PGYRRN4Zc.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"Kazuki Matsunaga","role":"Tanishi (voice)","photo":"/vVPaIOATSYv5tRjENuAHnVfBQuT.jpg"},{"name":"千本木彩花","role":"Ai (voice)","photo":"/yLRKX9DPDGgTRKBQRFTUh3pvbU0.jpg","en":"Sayaka Senbongi"},{"name":"小倉唯","role":"Tomo (voice)","photo":"/vUuyLWde2CEd5G0oqeEzzFE6qqA.jpg","en":"Yui Ogura"},{"name":"駒形友梨","role":"Mashima-san (voice)","photo":"/uBUkCOzPYQPbdADtrwxiRrqSB9c.jpg","en":"Yuri Komagata"},{"name":"間宮康弘","role":"Teacher (voice)","photo":"/pvnOU0RZuMKeISDTBEU7uSt3Xkn.jpg","en":"Yasuhiro Mamiya"},{"name":"ماریکو هوندا","role":"Kurobe (voice)","photo":"/29XsXfTmJ6dat7cBvQk6Wc96IC0.jpg","en":"Mariko Honda"},{"name":"木下鈴奈","role":"Misaki Komaba (voice)","photo":"/6p91pFf5jlObh10APG3IFOLfOTy.jpg","en":"Suzuna Kinoshita"},{"name":"میتسوهیرو ایچیکی","role":"Takashi Komaba (voice)","photo":"/2bmunMO1NTiZHymLQKZog2qxLfx.jpg","en":"Mitsuhiro Ichiki"},{"name":"綾瀬有","role":"Utako (voice)","photo":"/lazOmGxIzw1yAQB6iGx1GX1inR7.jpg","en":"Yuu Ayase"},{"name":"荒浪和沙","role":"Akemi (voice)","photo":"/3EpBcTAlSqlPd9q2VQZtDUvEgX6.jpg","en":"Kazusa Aranami"},{"n